.dev/design-refs/ant-design-system/project/ui_kits/admin/README.md:45:Both **Agents** and **MCP servers** are versioned and individually exposable:
.dev/design-refs/ant-design-system/project/ui_kits/admin/README.md:46:- **Edit always writes to a draft.** Every version carries an editable config
.dev/design-refs/ant-design-system/project/ui_kits/admin/README.md:48:  touches the live version — it creates or updates a **draft** while the **active**
.dev/design-refs/ant-design-system/project/ui_kits/admin/README.md:49:  version keeps serving. The detail drawer shows the active config plus a draft
.dev/design-refs/ant-design-system/project/ui_kits/admin/README.md:53:  **Revert** an active version back to draft to roll back — the most recent archived
.dev/design-refs/ant-design-system/project/ui_kits/admin/README.md:54:  version is restored to active. New agents start as a **v1 draft**.
.dev/design-refs/ant-design-system/project/ui_kits/admin/README.md:59:  endpoint, enabled tools) — no draft/version lifecycle.
